=\left(\frac32\right)^{m-1}(3000-3d)\]由\(a_m=4000\)，得\[4000=2d+3000\left(\frac32\right)^{m-1}
-3d\left(\frac32\right)^{m-1}\]整理并乘以\(2^{m-1}\)，得到\[d=\frac{3000\cdot3^{m-1}-4000\cdot2^{m-1}}{3^m-2^m}
=\frac{1000\left(3^m-2^{m+1}\right)}{3^m-2^m}\]

